        lv_obj_remove_style_all(bar);
        lv_obj_set_pos(bar, x, 0);
        lv_obj_set_size(bar, 4, 720);
        lv_obj_set_style_bg_color(bar, lv_color_hex(0xFFFFFF), 0);
        lv_obj_set_style_bg_opa(bar, LV_OPA_COVER, 0);
        lv_obj_set_style_radius(bar, 0, 0);
        lv_obj_set_style_border_width(bar, 0, 0);
        lv_obj_remove_flag(bar, LV_OBJ_FLAG_SCROLLABLE);
    }

Expected: 12 evenly-spaced 4px bars. Observed: visibly uneven spacing immediately around the bar at x=360.

## Notes

Happy to attach macro photos of the affected region and/or cross-post to lvgl/lvgl if the team determines this is core LVGL software-rendering behavior rather than something in the adapter/BSP layer.

